<cl=A2A2A2>
The Assassins Guild is the most mysterious and secret of all the guilds in the Sphere.
They don't pay much attention to elemental magic and endurance training here,
but the agility of the Assassins has become legendary. The mysterious ability to be
Invisibility makes an assassin a deadly enemy. The assassins know for sure,
where to hit so that the damage to the enemy is maximum.
In addition, they are recognized experts in poisons.
